imary evidence base. The third enrichment attempt returned no valid pathway hits due to m/z feature resolution failure in mummichog. Evidence gaps exist for direct biochemical linkage of the pyrroline derivatives to specific enzymatic steps within the HUMAN1 pathway roster. The differential abundance pattern is most consistent with a central disruption of tryptophan catabolism, affecting all three major downstream branches simultaneously.",
